        "title": "串: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "串 counts a string of connected items, such as grapes. Distinguish the whole string from its individual pieces.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我买了一串葡萄。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le yī chuàn pútao 。",
                "meaning": "I bought a bunch of grapes.",
                "audio": "f60ec140ccd0319f361e083a14978d9fbb408fdf243d259e9b8ca82cc92e391f"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里有两串钥匙。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ yǒu liǎng chuàn yàoshi 。",
                "meaning": "There are two bunches of keys here.",
